=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  config edit-keys ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. sshKeys: each key by type, comment$
# and fingerprint, never whole. A line that is no key is$
# refused.$
$
# Edit a setting ###############################################$
$
   1) username             george$
   2) sshKeys              1 key$
   3) sshPort              2222$
   4) disableRootSSH       true$
   5) enableUfwSshPolicy   true$
   6) configureDns         true$
   7) syslogServers        None$
   8) ntpServers           None$
   9) kernel               false$
  10) confirmTimeout       3m$
  11) checkReleases        false$
  12) enableUnattendedUpgrades  true$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-12 or q]: $
$
# sshKeys ######################################################$
$
  Keys ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Key$
      ssh-ed25519 george@laptop-1 SHA256:RXm/ruZ0eTzRXKwi1AQE...$
$
   1) Add key$
   2) Remove key$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]: $
$
# sshKeys ######################################################$
$
  Enter SSH public key [0 or q]: $
  (x) Not an SSH public key hardn takes$
  Enter SSH public key [0 or q]: $
$
$

